WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.517
Telo Ride is dark beside the bike. A device that asks for light gets light.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.161
From the very first paint. The page used to open dark and flip to light a moment

00:00:15.161 --> 00:00:19.271
later; now it paints the device's theme before the app has run.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:28.041
Every text colour is measured on every surface, in both themes. Three pairs read

00:00:28.041 --> 00:00:32.191
four point four eight to one; now they all pass four and a half.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.061
Match device is still the default, and Dark or Light in Settings holds whatever the

00:00:41.061 --> 00:00:42.073
device asks.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:52.852
A ride in light: the same role tokens, never a raw colour.

00:00:59.361 --> 00:01:02.009
Home in light, from a phone to the full screen.

00:01:09.685 --> 00:01:14.288
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:14.633 --> 00:01:19.145
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:20.816
every hill and interval.

00:01:21.161 --> 00:01:26.339
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:26.339 --> 00:01:31.787
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:31.787 --> 00:01:34.777
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:35.123 --> 00:01:37.615
A custom workout lives under Profile.
